{"reviewId": "426066534_88IuZ16ie", "review": {"abstract": "这两方面都充分展示了发展资本市场的重要性，也必然为日后中国虚拟经济大繁荣埋下伏笔。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "实体需要筹措资金，百业待兴，老百姓手里有钱。根据这两个条件06年那个时间点我认为作者推测虚拟市场繁荣是合理的。\n\n而眼下不合适，最主要有几点，一是06年的百姓有钱是中低收入群体收入快速增长，现在虽然总量大，但是财富到底在谁手里是个问题；\n\n二是居民（尤其伪中产）的高负债，及资产负债表受损导致人人自危，只敢存钱还债；\n\n三是大A市场本身你要说不行，体量又快100万亿了，你要说行又各种暴雷各种违规，，指不定宝马进去，宝骏出来，谁敢上？\n\n四是那勾日的特朗普，跟绝经期一样不稳定，导致市场没有稳定预期，资金趋向于避险", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "29166-29207", "createTime": 1777421358, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "426066534_88IuZ16ie", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1777422088, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 9, "likes": [{"userVid": 7327142, "name": "Miss🍬", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKIdGUpU8iaY3ONWcGT27XAk9rrJeNWXbT9M5wqAXlwdmJicyFIUAGn4fbroFWH27iaj0AFtGjH2DVTdDVVYxLonMkibIHm0XMsr5dKdfILdKHNmQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Miss🍬", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPr